<view class="login-page">
  <view class="login-content">
    <view class="brand"><view class="brand-mark">班</view><view><text class="brand-name">班达教师端</text><text class="brand-desc">班级事务，一触即达</text></view></view>
    <view class="welcome">
      <text class="welcome-title">连接教室，随时处理班级事务</text>
      <text class="welcome-desc">先创建小程序教师账户，再用它登录电脑教师端。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="scan-panel">
      <view class="scan-icon">
        <view class="corner c1"></view><view class="corner c2"></view><view class="corner c3"></view><view class="corner c4"></view>
        <view class="scan-center"></view>
      </view>
      <text class="scan-title">创建小程序教师账户</text>
      <text class="scan-desc">账户创建成功后，进入“我的—登录电脑教师端”扫描电脑二维码。</text>
      <button class="primary scan-button" bindtap="openRegister">创建教师账户</button>
    </view>

    <view class="privacy-row">
      <view class="privacy-icon">✓</view>
      <text>二维码不含账户和教室数据，配对成功后立即失效。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="privacy-row">
      <view class="privacy-icon">i</view>
      <text>连接失败时会显示网络检查步骤，调整后可直接重新扫码。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <page-container show="{{registerOpen}}" position="bottom" round overlay bind:clickoverlay="closeRegister">
    <view class="register-sheet">
      <view class="register-handle"></view>
      <view class="register-title"><view><text>创建教师账户</text><text>创建后可独立添加教室，也可生成连接码与电脑教师端同步。</text></view><text class="register-close" bindtap="closeRegister">×</text></view>
      <text class="register-label">教师姓名</text>
      <input class="register-field" maxlength="20" placeholder="请输入真实姓名" value="{{registerName}}" bindinput="setRegisterName"/>
      <view class="register-tip">账户身份仅保存在当前微信设备；登录电脑教师端时通过扫码安全传输。</view>
      <button class="primary register-confirm" bindtap="registerAccount">创建账户</button>
    </view>
  </page-container>
</view>
